# "Two target creatures" needs two legal targets (CR 601.2c): with Llanowar Elves the only creature in the game, Symbiosis is not
# offered although Bot1 can pay for it. The control is symbiosis-gives-two-target-creatures-plus-two-plus-two, the same position
# with a second creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mountain
Symbiosis
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
! Bot1.Hand.Symbiosis.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

